==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{der|ru|trk}}, ultimately from {{der|ru|ltc|派|tr=pài|t=to hand out, distribute}}. Compare {{cog|tr|pay}}, {{cog|alt|пай}}, {{cog|tt|пай}}, {{cog|uz|пай}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-пай.ogg}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Tatiana Kerbush-пай.wav|a=Saint Petersburg}}
* {{rhymes|ru|aj|s=1}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|c|adj=паево́й}}

# [[share]], [[interest]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[вступи́тельный]] '''пай'''|t=initial shares}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[на]] '''пая́х'''|t=shared; jointly owned; co-owned; in joint ownership; jointly}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[держа́ть]] [[на]] '''пая́х'''|t=co-own, share}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[това́рищество]] [[на]] '''пая́х'''|t=partnership, joint commercial venture}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[на]] [[равный|ра́вных]] '''пая́х'''|t=with equal shares}}

